}
```
At z=0? first ell extends z 0..2.4; hull bottom z0. x max16.2. At z<7 x max? hull between ell, x radius up to2.0 at z15; at z7 x max maybe14.2+1.9=16.1. Good. At z=6 x maybe16.0. Connector starts16.2, gap 0.2?! It must connect to pillar. Connector x from16.2 to22; if pillar at z0..7 max x maybe16.2 at z15 but at low z max x=16.0, connector start16.2 leaves 0.2 gap -> disconnected! Need connector begin at15.0 and overlap pillar. But connector at x15..16.2 inside pillar; from 16.2..22 thin. Set cube start x=15.0 length7 to22; y±1.5. It passes through pillar. This is okay; at x<16.2 part of pillar. At z0..7. No ring until16.8. Connector width3. Good.
