Eyes spheres at(-29.5,±7.6,46.2) r1.5 maybe extend y to9.1, okay. Add snout nostrils at(-37.8,±2.4,43.3) r0.6. Mouth groove: subtract from body? Since body_fixed module union then difference could be done:
