hull centers 24.6 r4.5 -> x29.1, 28.4 r3.4 ->31.8. Difference circle jb r5.7 => west edge29.8. leaves body x from ring to29.8, but hull at28.4 r3.4 extends. Good. Connector start29.0. Overlap.
